# 7. Sparklines: gtExtras Method



::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code  code-fold="true" code-summary="Data Preparation"}
report <- coffeechain %>%
  mutate(Year = year(Date)) %>%
  filter(Year == "2013") %>%
  mutate (Month = month(Date, 
                        label = TRUE, 
                        abbr = TRUE)) %>%
  group_by(Product, Month) %>%
  summarise(Sales = sum(Sales)) %>%
  ungroup()
```
:::



We need to convert the report data.frame into list columns as part of the `gtExtras` functions requirements.



::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code  code-fold="true" code-summary="Converting to list columns"}
report %>%
  group_by(Product) %>%
  summarize('Monthly Sales' = list(Sales), 
            .groups = "drop")
```

