## 7.3 Combining the data.frame



::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code  code-fold="true" code-summary="Add statics on the tables"}
spark <- report %>%
  group_by(Product) %>%
  summarize('Monthly Sales' = list(Sales), 
            .groups = "drop")

sales <- report %>% 
  group_by(Product) %>% 
  summarise("Min" = min(Sales, na.rm = T),
            "Max" = max(Sales, na.rm = T),
            "Average" = mean(Sales, na.rm = T)
            )
```
:::

::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code  code-fold="true" code-summary="Joining the 2 tables"}
sales_data = left_join(sales, spark)
```
:::



## 7.4 Plotting the Updated data.table



::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code  code-fold="true" code-summary="Plotting sales_data sparklines"}
sales_data %>%
  gt() %>%
  gt_plt_sparkline('Monthly Sales',
                   same_limit = FALSE)
```

